.TH sync 1  "sync " 
.SH NAME
sync \- Fetch a remote and report its topology relative to the workspace base
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsync\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIREMOTE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fetch a remote and report its topology relative to the workspace base
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH COLLABORATION
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
<\fIREMOTE\fR>
Configured remote name
